# Modelfile.smart -- sim-smart (MODEL_SMART)
#
# Provenance: FROM the Qwen3.5-9B-Q4_K_M GGUF already cached on disk by the
# now-retired LM Studio install (see docs/plan-ollama-migration.md Phase 0/1
# and the "Ollama Phase 0 findings (2026-07-24)" section of TASKS_PENDING.md).
# Reusing this file instead of a registry pull saved a ~5.2 GB download and
# was verified to import cleanly (`ollama create probe-smart -f ...` in
# 52.2s, Phase 0 finding #1/#6).
#
# num_ctx 20480: successor to lms_config.md's LM Studio context budget
# (20000, parallel 3, ~6666 tokens/slot) -- see ollama_config.md for the
# current budget table and VRAM gate numbers.
#
# Sampling params mirror simulation/server.py's NON_THINKING_SAMPLING dict
# (top_p 0.8, top_k 20, min_p 0) plus the routine-decision default
# temperature (0.4, see lm_agent_decision_payload in server.py). These are
# defaults only -- server.py still sends per-request `options` on every
# call and those override the Modelfile PARAMETER values; baking them in
# here just keeps ad-hoc/manual `ollama run sim-smart` sessions and the
# fast-model quality screen behaving the same way the sim does.
#
# NO SYSTEM directive here -- Phase 6 of the migration plan adds `SYSTEM
# <SYSTEM_PROMPT text>` (generated from server.py, never hand-copied) once
# the load-time-rulebook feature is gated and enabled. Until then every
# request supplies its own system message exactly as the LM Studio-era code
# did, and Ollama's Modelfile SYSTEM/no-SYSTEM semantics guarantee that is
# safe (Phase 0 finding #6: an explicit request-time system message always
# overrides -- there is nothing to accidentally shadow yet, and there is
# nothing baked in to shadow it with).
#
# Canonical applier: scripts/ollama_setup.py (`ollama create sim-smart -f
# ollama/Modelfile.smart`, idempotent, safe to re-run). Do not `ollama
# create` this by hand outside that script -- it also handles env vars,
# service restart, and warm-up/residency verification.

FROM C:\Users\dbadmin\.lmstudio\models\lmstudio-community\Qwen3.5-9B-GGUF\Qwen3.5-9B-Q4_K_M.gguf

PARAMETER num_ctx 20480
PARAMETER temperature 0.4
PARAMETER top_p 0.8
PARAMETER top_k 20
PARAMETER min_p 0
